00:00:04.367 --> 00:00:06.189
GLP-1 is a natural hormone

00:00:06.200 --> 00:00:07.704
that helps manage blood sugar

00:00:07.884 --> 00:00:09.568
appetite and food intake

00:00:10.600 --> 00:00:11.384
It is made in your

00:00:11.394 --> 00:00:12.878
gut and released when sensors

00:00:12.888 --> 00:00:14.541
detect nutrients like sugars and

00:00:14.551 --> 00:00:15.113
proteins

00:00:16.167 --> 00:00:17.978
When proteins are digested their

00:00:17.989 --> 00:00:20.320
breakdown products may trigger GLP-1

00:00:20.330 --> 00:00:20.796
release

00:00:21.867 --> 00:00:25.069
Clinical weight loss doctor-led Questions

00:00:25.800 --> 00:00:27.209
Ask a Steer doctor at

00:00:27.220 --> 00:00:28.364
